netboard-policy 1
# Zero-egress starting point for CG-agent-harness on one Mac.
# Ports are from its shipped assets/config.default.yaml; check yours.
# Web search, Firecrawl, hosted providers and Git publication all reach
# public hosts, so with any of them enabled this policy reports violations.
# That is the point: add an allow rule only for egress you mean to permit.

# Local models: Ollama and LM Studio.
allow loopback proto tcp port 11434
allow loopback proto tcp port 1234

# The console (`serve`) and its own loopback clients.
allow loopback proto tcp port 8790
listen loopback proto tcp port 8790

# The inbound MCP memory gateway ships disabled; uncomment if you enable it.
# listen loopback proto tcp port 8791
# allow loopback proto tcp port 8791
